          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. What is the parity of the sum of numbers from 1 to 100? Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The parity is even. [Hint– Add numbers from 1 to 100.]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.186,
            0.927,
            0.248
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. Two consecutive numbers in the Virahanka sequence are 987 and 1597. What are the next 2 numbers in the sequence? What are the previous 2 numbers in the sequence?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.251,
            0.17,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.27,
            0.433,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The next two numbers are:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.291,
            0.344,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "987 + 1597 = 2584"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.312,
            0.352,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1597 + 2584 = 4181"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.333,
            0.475,
            0.353
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The previous two numbers are:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.354,
            0.33,
            0.373
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1597 – 987 = 610"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.375,
            0.319,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "987 – 610 = 377"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.395,
            0.672,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The sequence is …, 377, 610, 987, 1597, 2584, 4181, …"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.431,
            0.926,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. Angaan wants to climb an 8 - step staircase. His playful rule is that he can take either 1 step or 2 steps at a time. For example, one of his paths is 1, 2, 2, 1, 2. In how many different ways can he reach the top?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.496,
            0.17,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.511,
            0.787,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.255,
                0.511,
                0.787,
                0.857
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_30_table_14.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Different Ways</td><td>Number of ways</td></tr><tr><td>1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 21, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1...</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 21, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2...</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>1, 1, 2, 2, 21, 2, 2, 2, 1...</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>2, 2, 2, 2</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.873,
            0.926,
            0.914
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the total ways in which Angaan reaches the top = 1 + 7 + 15 + 10 + 1 = 34 ways."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
